* GPL-3.0. Author: Dusan Halicky (dvhx). Original models.js and license are included.
* Converted the first fit per named diode to SPICE syntax; numbers are unchanged.
* _IVFIT is an explicit name suffix: measured sample FORWARD DC ONLY.
* NO reverse breakdown, capacitance, reverse recovery or temperature characterization.
* Two-terminal die I-V only: ER1002CT is not a complete three-pin dual diode package.

